= BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_EventScript_HintWeather
msgbox	RAIN DANCE… SUNNY DAY… SANDSTORM… HAIL…I see POKéMON that become stronger with the weather……And, I see your POKéMON confounded by different types of moves…
return
= BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_EventScript_HintFighting
msgbox	I see FIGHTING-type POKéMON……And, I see your POKéMON pummeled by FIGHTING moves…
return
= BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_EventScript_HintRock
msgbox	I see ROCK-type POKéMON……And, I see your POKéMON suffering from ROCK moves…
