return
= BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_EventScript_HintLevitate
msgbox	I see POKéMON loftily airborne……And, I see your POKéMON frustrated by powerless GROUND-type moves…
return
= BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_EventScript_HintPPWaste
msgbox	I sense the tremendous pressure of unrequited anger…It is a curse……And, I see your POKéMON drained of Power Points and having no recourse but to use STRUGGLE…
return
= BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_EventScript_HintBurn
msgbox	I see bright red flames……And, I see your POKéMON suffering from burns…
return
= BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_EventScript_HintPoison
msgbox	I see poison……And, I see your POKéMON suffering from the effects of poison…
return
= BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_EventScript_HintParalysis
msgbox	I see a shower of sparks……And in it, I see your POKéMON struggling with paralysis…
return
= BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_EventScript_GiveHintGetLvOpenStreak
pyramid_get PYRAMID_DATA_WIN_STREAK_OPEN
goto BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_EventScript_DoHintComment
return
